{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-one-little-bite-v7-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "e918e7568c078eb4b693c833290f899a925e577ab1a6a42a398dccb00122edbd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ec3d7ffe9eed18b57fd6d1ddf8af642d76d842b841406f6c163d0d80550fc40",
      "text": "悟空\n尝一小口",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b28b1c81d326b0267595926cf919b6b33173083559e3fed9e7e8e27dbab3a7e",
      "text": "太阳慢慢落山了。\n悟空抱着他的桃子。\n“我只吃桃子！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32d4e8588de3456ae84aae6123197e8f1a452c3ec770b3c557f2d8239dacb220",
      "text": "“来帮忙做晚饭吧。”\n八戒说。\n悟空帮忙洗胡萝卜。\n哗啦！鼻子也湿了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b5a212f2c870fc1a475bc992853f893bb8763810ac4199946ea943fb2f0671a",
      "text": "沙僧搅着锅里的菜。\n一片叶子落在\n悟空的桃子上。\n“我的桃子戴帽子啦！”\n他咯咯地笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3138a8dd73a5fa8ac4f77987267d71221a53cdd5bee3fc1da765e92cba5acb14",
      "text": "一股香味飘过来。\n“那是什么呀？”悟空问。\n“热乎乎的胡萝卜呀。”\n沙僧说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8702680d3db141e85016c30adb857dce1265167235e35eec9b882dd1b77538da",
      "text": "悟空尝了一小口。\n“哦！又甜又软。”\n他把桃子\n放在碗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b623ae2b4896c1a2c0031acf08f0bda371a98b489a658c7816069e6cf7c6e4e",
      "text": "“再尝一口青菜？”\n悟空尝了一小片菜叶。\n“嗯……又软又多汁！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "291d4fd4534a984fcea32d922b0ad3e861a75b4536094b270e2fa68c12ce03f0",
      "text": "他尝了米饭，\n还有小块小块的豆腐。\n这个尝一点，\n那个尝一点。\n“我的碗里有新朋友啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf510cd051f1204e97903fc5777d9d4b9da4d8d7853eadea3b0cbd5cffc1be62",
      "text": "月光洒在餐桌上。\n悟空吃完最后一口桃子。\n“我喜欢的不光是桃子啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e5279d62eee87d014bf03cd11065ec12582abaf8a6c282c76122bd796ad1e988",
      "text": "悟空钻进被窝。\n“晚安，小碗。\n晚安，朋友们。”\n明天，他还可以\n尝尝新东西。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c9453464dac037dd8ba6c4a5aa623a01e46ef403c0198d4e3f5b9e377a8f8de9",
